{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c126ac79dfd9e5a96866cc171677e33438d1b6e4c382212b74a4e601b8e54368",
      "text": "节目当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d971f33dc0f3cf2067bc5231510ea500ccfcf4c7f007afdb55492d0769b864",
      "text": "“由我来当新王？\n为什么……那原本应该是哥哥的梦想才对啊。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813f585ee4574f8111a1dee0662fd7a3d668ccf59d5306f05652cd839186766d",
      "text": "“不。我只是被唆使着去怀抱那个梦想罢了。\n……多亏了你，我才意识到了自己真正的心意。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74015dba123b1e24787a590d434339c519a236d0b295849d3d3999c270f0c12",
      "text": "“从今往后，作为王，也是我深爱的弟弟，\n我会一直支持你。这才是我的新梦想。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68ff60353ca539293dd13edb0d28999ec5f3c165774c9a8a53b22fe29f259ca9",
      "text": "“……唉，看来只能放弃出走了。毕竟体弱多病的你，\n加上古板的哥哥，还不知道会出什么乱子呢。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2dedb2575a9c1586cde2357bd9207024a27ebbaac9e8123504b4f6358da8a49",
      "text": "“我也留在这个国家。暂时可以依靠我一把哦。\n虽说守规矩那一套我可不在行。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3df246399da63b73104870f8741ef11a797da2afe7cff18af258f5f5fd5c8265",
      "text": "“谢谢你们……。我一定会，\n成为一个能让大家引以为傲的国王。我保证！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24253bff0f85713c18894caa1dda0c8875961eef26d043358d2dd3f78a1b6b1f",
      "text": "卡——！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f25dea80e4ed2b845d1f9be2220850b96b58ea7d05d03ebeb5ecf9ac8ef7508",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！\n怎么样？刚才超帅的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae3a5c289093357cb5d75ed0b46e06dd48174d2218c6faccbea451a6a28d2ae2",
      "text": "嗯，非常帅气哦。\n大家的演技都很逼真传神！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ef8b3095b79f241b32c29af2f9f6fe07a1ef009fd3a74b8e776c84f4457c3a8",
      "text": "呼……刚才还忐忑会不会搞砸呢，\n但最后彻底沉浸进去了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f85541a649b28bd175cfecccc909321b7130bb9f7792a946b8c661aa74d6b2bf",
      "text": "而且，超级开心的呢。虽然也有过很多辛苦的事，\n但花音能和大家一起出场太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ceaf56e30bcbb2b0ff60c157f570205bdbc125c3f751a754b5ca76070c7295",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……我也是。果然もふもふえん是个\n很厉害的组合，让我有了自信……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70ca70d24d04346c06f7425d982c70e03565d0d6c83e984e8ca3c683023528a",
      "text": "哎哎，现在才反应过来吗！？直央你真是的，\n到底是胆小还是有骨气啊，真搞不懂你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8d6d0a3c48d3982257325aad4190e5bfc739a6996f3022f2bde0e3724da2815",
      "text": "啊，呃，我是说重新感受到了啦……！\n呜呜，抱歉……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25b0af926446e40debeb909dc87453cd192ea330bf758a07b2ac9bdf01133993",
      "text": "嘛，这不挺好的嘛？今天啊，\n演戏时的直央……真不愧是你，魄力十足呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_j:cmd-000194:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2678d1cee2178d4461002664b287d7f53a6de67f909f2d2943bbb646089c7207",
      "text": "我们もふもふえん的力量，\n绝对已经传达给看过的每一个人了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
